window.products.push({"id":478031,"name":"FABULETTA Cordless Vacuum Cleaner, 25 kpa Stick Vacuum 6 in 1 Set with 8 x 2500mAh Large Battery, Max 50 min Runtime, 250W Brushless Motor Handheld Va","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":139.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gwM+9RqGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Upgraded Brushless Motor & Powerful Suction】: With the 250W Brushless Motor, FSV003 cordless vacuum cleaner will generate 25Kpa Strong Suction on MAX mode. Compared with other regular brushed motors, The Brushless Motors are controlled by electronic components, which generate less heat and are more energy-efficient, because there are no built-in carbon brushes, so they will not wear out and have a longer service life. 【Detachable Battery & 50 Mins Long Runtime 】: The detachable 8x2500mAh large capacity battery provide long lasting runtime. If you purchase additional batteries, the runtime will be doubled.The wireless vacuum cleaner has 3 suction modes: Eco Mode (12KPa suction for 50 mins), Standard Mode (18KPa for 35 mins), and Max Mode (25KPa for 25 mins). 【Powerful 6-in-1 & Plus Handheld】: With LED floor brush, 2 in 1 dust brush, long crevice tube and adjustable alloy tube, they can be assembled arbitrarily into 6 modes for easy cleaning of floor, sofa, stairs, car, curtains etc. With LED headlights to illuminate furniture in the dark corner. A flexible 180°swivel sideways and 90°up and down, It glides to the dust, cat litter, dog food, pet hair under furniture or other hard-to-reach dark corner and pulls it out with ease. 【High-Efficiency HEPA Filtration System】: With 6 stages fully sealed cyclone filtration system, the cordless stick vacuum cleaner can capture 99.99% of dust as small as 0.1 microns, thus it will exhale ultimate purified air, effectively avoiding secondary pollution and bringing fresher air to your family. Send an extra HEPA filter, regularly cleaning the HEPA will prevent weak suction and blockages. 【1.2L Removable Dust Cup】: The stick vacuum has large & removable dust cup which is designed for cleaning large space, it can accommodate more garbage and pet hair at one time. Empty trash with one click, easy to use. NOTE: Please don't worry about after sales, we offer 12-month 100% satisfactory after-sales service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gwM+9RqGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FABULETTA","source_asin":"B0C1YY3DW6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-478031","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C1YY3DW6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C1YY3DW6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":478032,"name":"JXS Steel Heavy Two-Prong Cork Puller with Cover, Cork Remover Fantastic Way to Open a Wne Bottle Wine Opener","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/515zfcEUUPL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"JXS Steel Heavy Two-Prong Cork Puller with Cover, Cork Remover Fantastic Way to Open a Wne Bottle Wine Opener Much, much better than a corkscrew, I first got a cork puller as a promotional item, years ago, and in the course of several moves I lost it. I finally decided it was long past time to quit fighting with corkscrews and go back to what works. This cork puller is well made and I expect it to last the rest of my life--with no more destroyed corks to worry about. It's easy to slip in (just rock it back and forth while pushing gently), and to remove a whole, undamaged cork, just twist and pull. When I first got this I did have to wrap a rubber band around the prong cover to get enough grip to remove it, but that's probably due to arthritis. I also wiped down the prongs. And then I used it to successfully remove, in seconds, a cork which had been pretty thoroughly mutilated by a corkscrew without ever budging from the bottle. I'm very, very happy with this item. Fantastic way to open a wine bottle! This product allows you to easily open a wine bottle and remove the entire cork without damaging it in any way. You can re-cork the wine bottle if needed, but it is better to finish the whole bottle of wine, as far as I am concerned. if you collect corks, this will allow you to add to your collection without damaging the cork when you remove it from the wine bottle. Great product. Love this cork puller! Great tool to have for a wine lover. This tool has now saved the day more than once. For older corks, a traditional type of cork screw won't generally work without breaking the cork. I have used this multiple times now and it's easy to get the hang of. I would highly recommend this item as it's well made and come with a nice matching protective case.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/515zfcEUUPL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JXS","source_asin":"B082PSL7G4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-478032","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082PSL7G4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082PSL7G4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
