window.products.push({"id":478100,"name":"GRORA 2-Pack Air Fryer Silicone Liners, 8.5 Inch, Non-Stick, Heat-Resistant, Easy to Clean Square Liners for 5-8 Quart Air Fryer - Reusable, Blue and ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61rBdYjXw+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Highly Recommended Air Fryer Accessories】2 packs- Square air fryer liners silicone holders specially designed for air fryers. prevent food from sticking to the bottom of the air fryer basket and make cleanup a breeze. Suitable for 5qt, 6qt, 7qt, and 8qt air fryers, and more. Make sure to choose a size that fits your air fryer basket for the best results. 【Safe and Reliable Liners for Air Fryer Basket】Silicone pad for air fryer is made of food-grade silicone material with non-toxic, non-stick, and heat-resistant. it replaces the flammable parchment liner and is safe to use in high-temperature settings. They can withstand temperatures up to -40°C-450°F(240°C) which is much higher than the typical air frying temperature. This means you can use them to cook a wide variety of foods without any worries about damaging the liner. 【Reusable Silicone Air Fryer Liners】Air fryer liner silicone only needs to be purchased once and can be used repeatedly. It can also help preserve the life of your air fryer by preventing scratches and damage to the basket, which is more environmentally friendly and economical than disposable parchment paper plates for anyone who uses their air fryer frequently. And they can be easily washed with soap and water or placed in the dishwasher for easy cleaning. 【Absolutely Practical Design】Air fryer silicone pot is designed to fit the air fryer. The wavy stripes are heated evenly, and can also isolate food and oil stains, making it really easy to clean; the handle design on both sides of the silicone air fryer liners square is more practical, and you can directly take the food out. No worry about impact on food flavor or air circulation. 【Widely Applicated Airfryer Accessory】The newly upgraded oven air fryer basket is highly recommended as your must-have cooking fryer accessory, suitable for air fryers, ovens, microwave ovens, instant pots, steamers, etc.; the Air fryer silicone liner is given to cooking lovers around you the perfect gift.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61rBdYjXw+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GRORA","source_asin":"B0C2D6BQ66","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-478100","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C2D6BQ66","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C2D6BQ66","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
