window.products.push({"id":478250,"name":"Electric Power Lift Recliner Chair for Elderly with Massage and Heat, 3 Positions Vibration, Soft Breath Fabric Chair with 2 Side Pockets & USB Charge","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hZA62R0eL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Product description: GIODIR Power Lift Recliner chair, Electric recliner Sofa for Elderly with Heating and Vibration Massage, 3 Positions, Soft Breath Fabric Sofa with 2 Side Pockets & USB Charge Port for Living Room, Bedroom Features: Sturdy and durable metal frame, well support the weight and ensure safe use. Thick and soft sponge padded back, seat and armrest for comfortable. Power lift helps the elders stand up easily, and reduces their backs and knees pressure. Lift & Recline control panel on the right armrest, easy to operate. 6-point massage system, 5 modes vibration, 2 level vibration intensity. Heating functions promote healthy blood circulation. Function of timer 15/30/60 mins, free to set the time of operating. USB charging port will allow you charging your devices. Two side pockets on both armrest for storage. Easy to assmbly.Instruction manual included. Item Specifications: Color: Golden Material: Fabric Production Dimensions: 30.3\"(W) x 37.6\"(L) x 25.8\"(H) Seated Size: 23.7\"(W) x 22.1\"(D) x 16.5\"(H) Reclining Angle: 140° Max Capacity: 330lbs Package Included: 1 x Power Lift Recliner chair 1 x Remote control 1 x Assembly instruction Note: Come with 2 boxes, please wait one more day if does not arrive on the same day. Please feel free to contact us if chair damaged or have any concerns when you receive the item. GIODIR Return Policy: Returns & exchange within 30 days. Warranty Information: One year warranty, the needed replacement can be sent freely within 1 year.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hZA62R0eL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"giodir","source_asin":"B08HRT81PD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-478250","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08HRT81PD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08HRT81PD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":478251,"name":"Floral Joy Collection - Premium Quality, Soft, Wrinkle, Fade, & Stain Resistant, Easy Care, Oversized Duvet Cover Set, Twin / Twin XL","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91uoO-fpd3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HIGH QUALITY CRAFTSMANSHIP & OUR SIGNATURE FABRIC: You spend all day working hard.  You deserve quality sleep in Extremely gentle, comfortable, and smooth Duvet Cover Set.  These are made with our premium 110 GSM Double-Brushed fabric and & the softest duvets we have to offer. Our Duvets are breathable, Light weight, double-brushed for extra softness, shrinkage and fade resistant. WHAT IS INCLUDED? Your purchase contains 1 Duvet Twin / Twin XL Duvet Cover (69 inches x 98 inches) and 1 Sham (20 inches x 26 inches). Duvet has a high-quality zipper closure allowing you to easily replace your favorite insert (comforter) and 4 corner ties to keep it securely in place. This set does not come with an insert / comforter as it is a duvet cover set. We do sell matching comforters that fit the duvet cover perfectly in a separate listing. A BRAND NAME & LARGE ASSORTMENT: These duvets are high Quality and made under our flagship double brushed microfiber fabric. Available in dozens of colors and prints and 3 sizes, there is something available for everyone. Matching Sheet Sets, quilt sets and comforter sets are also available to complete the collection. 30-DAY RISK-FREE GUARANTEE: Our products are high quality & we back them up with a Risk & worry-free 30-day guarantee. If you are not satisfied for any reason, you can contact us to discuss return or refund options. Plus, our 1-YEAR warranty against any defects gives you one less thing to worry about. When you purchase a Southshore product, you are not just purchasing an exceptional quality home textile product, you are getting an absolute commitment on unmatched customer service as well. EASY CARE & FADE RESISTANT: Our duvets are made with Fade, Pilling & Wrinkle Resistant fabric. They will come out of the dryer looking fresh every time. These duvets are made with our Double-Brushed microfiber Fabric providing a substantially higher quality fabric and ultimate softness. Machine wash Cold, tumble dry. Do not use Bleach. Always close the zipper during washing to prevent snags.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91uoO-fpd3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Southshore Fine Living, Inc.","source_asin":"B0BJL5GWFT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-478251","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BJL5GWFT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BJL5GWFT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
