window.products.push({"id":478289,"name":"EOSRAY 3 Pieces Duvet Cover Set, Ball Pom Pom Fringe Tassel Bedding Cover, Ultra Soft Brushed Microfiber Duvet Cover Queen, 1 Duvet Cover and 2 Pillow","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Qgp8XmOoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description: 100% Polyester and stone-washed, the unique production process makes duvet cover sets more softness. Simple Design: Pom poms fringe trim, and the duvet cover with a hidden zipper, you can put your quilt into the duvet cover, four corners with a rope fixed. Size Information: Queen size: 1 x Duvet Cover 90 by 90inches(229cm x 229cm), 2 x Pillow shams 20 by 26inches(51cm x 66cm)A duvet cover is a protective layer that slips over the duvet inset, comforter, or blanket, and has a closure.The duvet cover also allows you to change the style or color choice of your bedding with the simple switch of the cover.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Qgp8XmOoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EOSRAY","source_asin":"B07VMHH3Q3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-478289","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VMHH3Q3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VMHH3Q3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":478290,"name":"TRANQUIL NIGHTS - 300 Thread Count 100% Cotton Bed Sheet Set, 4-Piece Light Blue King Size Sheets, Cool & Breathable Percale Sheets, Smooth Luxury Bed","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZupcDLJAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"300 Thread Count Percale HIGH QUALITY Long Staple Cotton - If you love the luxury and durability of hotel sheets, the look and feel of crisp cool sheets and pillowcases, you'll adore our luxurious cotton king sheet set 300 thread count. We use yarns made with 100% long staple premium cotton fibers for a soft and smooth percale weave. Our Eco-friendly king bed sheets retain softness for a lifetime and resist fading. Indulge in soft bedding with classic Z hem styling, also available in your choice of colors and sizes. KING SIZE Luxury 4 piece Bed Sheet Set - Each set includes 1 Flat Sheet: 108\" x 102\"; 1 Fully Elasticized Fitted Sheet: 78\" x 80\" + 17\" deep pocket and 2 Pillowcases: 20\" x 40\" (King Pillowcases). Fitted Sheet has deep pockets to fit mattresses from 9\" to 20\". Flat sheet & pillowcases come with a classic Z hem tailored stitch for a hotel collection look. Highest quality dye materials are used for fade resistance. Recommended for regular wash and short dry cycles for superior softness. LUXURY AND COMFORT - Imagine the quality of hotel linens with the perfection of individually handcrafted cotton sheets, all at an incredible price. Our team of artisans measures each bed linen individually and stitches them to perfection. Natural long staple cotton fibers are used for the premium quality of these extra deep pocket sheets set which will instantly transform your bedding space. The fabric is tested to ensure no harmful chemicals are used, and it is defect-free. QUALITY CERTIFIED STANDARD 100 by OEKO-TEX - Made in a vertically integrated factory certified for ISO-9001:2008, ISO-14001:2004 & ISO-18001:2007. SEDEX, OEKO-TEX and BSCI complied facility ensures sustainability, contribution to environment and corporate social responsibility. The fabric is thoroughly tested for meeting performance like no pilling, shrinkage, color fastness, tear strength and thread count authenticity before being individually measured and stitched to perfection. 100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEE - We specialize in manufacturing the best king size sheets & luxurious bedding in the industry. These breathable cool sheets use specially compacted yarns made from 100% long staple cotton. The fabric used in these premium organic cotton sheets are sweat-wicking and temperature balancing to keep you cool during summer and warm during winter. Our designs match any décor and are a wonderful gift idea for Valentine's, Mother's Day, Father's Day, and Christmas.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZupcDLJAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TRANQUIL NIGHTS","source_asin":"B07BDGXGC5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-478290","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07BDGXGC5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07BDGXGC5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
