window.products.push({"id":478292,"name":"Freestanding Reserved Cards for Wedding Reception Tables, 20 Pk Black and White Design. Double-Sided 5x5.5 Table Tents Are Elegant, Versatile Event De","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ZzZcWWPWL._AC_SL1311_.jpg","description":"Top off your event decor with our freestanding reserved table signs that set up in seconds and look effortlessly elegant. Remove seating stress from your reception setup using our 5 inch reserved signs for wedding that snap together in less than a minute! They're the perfect size to sit atop a dinner or salad plate, so you can use them to reserve individual seats or the whole table if you wish. How do I put my paperboard table tent together? Just crease the card at the pre-scored fold line, then fold the interlocking tabs together at the base -- and as easy as 1-2-3, your tabletop reserved sign is good to go! See our diagram in the table card photos for more details. Can I write on these reserved signs? Absolutely! You could easily personalize our black and white table reserved signs for your wedding, reception, quinceanera, banquet or luncheon with a black or metallic permanent marker. Just remember to allow the card to air dry before touching! Will my table reservation signs blow away in a breeze? While our prescored reserved signs are made from heavy-duty paperboard with a solid base, we do recommend weighting the base if you plan to use them for an outdoor wedding or event to prevent tipping. What’s in the box? Each package contains a pack of twenty (20) white foldable tent placards, each with slight floral embellishment and the word \"Reserved\" printed in black. Each card stands at 5 inches wide by 5.5 inches tall. Lifetime 100% money-back satisfaction guarantee! If you aren’t completely satisfied with your order, simply email us, and we will respond within 24 hours to make it right even on the weekends. We absolutely guarantee your satisfaction or your money back!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ZzZcWWPWL._AC_SL1311_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beacon Street Homegoods","source_asin":"B01MU3MKNM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-478292","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MU3MKNM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MU3MKNM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
