window.products.push({"id":478356,"name":"Gifts for Men, Whiskey Decanter Set Personalized | 12 Designs | Gifts for Husband, 5 PC Monogrammed Decanter with Tight Glass Stopper & 4 Whiskey Glas","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":64.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81bQqRadUWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"CLASSY GIFT FOR MEN OF TASTE: For every man who drinks with style, we present you with our liquor glass decanter set, allowing you to add a personal touch to every toast you make with your friends. Amaze your friends while serving them your favorite liquors - like whiskey, bourbon, scotch...- in our uniquely personalized whiskey decanter set and enhance the visuals of your drinking experiment. REMARKABLE GIFT FOR MANY OCCASIONS: Our personalized decanter sets are trustworthy without doubt, and they are ready to be shipped, being the best gift for your Father's Day, Dad's birthday, anniversaries, wedding, retirement housewarming gift for a new house… you name it. Any man receiving this gift will highly appreciate it, whether he was your father, brother, grandpa, husband, boss, or anyone else. PERSONALIZE YOUR FAVORITE DESIGN: When you click \" CUSTOMIZE NOW \", you can choose one of our 12 elegant designs and submit your customization details like initials, name/last name, and a year date to be included within the design you chose. MATERIAL & SPECIFICATIONS: The decanter and glasses are made from premium lead-free glass material, personalized with precise laser-engraving. The decanter can hold up to 24 oz ( 720 ml ) of your drink and has a glass stopper with airtight sealing to prevent oxidation by preventing overexposure to air. Each glass can hold up to 9 oz of liquid. TRUSTWORTHY BRAND NAME: Here at Personalization Lab, we specialized in personalizing and customizing gifts for weddings, couples, engagements, housewarmings, Christmas, and many more. If you had any queries regarding your order, please do not hesitate to contact our devoted customer service team.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81bQqRadUWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Personalization Lab","source_asin":"B0944BD2NL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-478356","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0944BD2NL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0944BD2NL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
