window.products.push({"id":478485,"name":"12oz Stainless Steel Wine Tumbler Glasses – Double Wall Vacuum Insulated Wine Tumbler with Lid – Perfect Cup for Wine, Coffee, Cocktails, Drinks – Ste","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71li7Nk++2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Do you know that feeling when you forget about your cold drink in the summer, and when you take a sip it’s already lukewarm? Everyone hates that feeling. What about when you’re going to work in the morning, and you get there and the coffee you’ve brewed is already cold. That’s no way of starting your day. Our stainless steel wine tumblers are the perfect solution! What we’re so convinced this tumbler will become your favorite glass? Because it’s so much more than a typical wine tumbler! Using a patented vacuuming technology, it is guaranteed to retain the temperature of your cold drinks for up to 9 hours, and for up to 3 hours for hot drinks. Some of the amazing features of the glass: ⭐️ Perfect for any drink, whether it’s wine, water, juice, tea, or coffee ⭐️ Versatile, the tumbler is great for home use or on the go, whether you’re going to the office, driving, having a picnic, or relaxing by the swimming pool ⭐ Modern design, the beautiful design and vivid colors will make an impression on anyone ⭐️ Incredibly durable, made from high-quality stainless steel, the glass is unbreakable ⭐️ Superior powder coating , providing a perfect finish to ensure the glass won’t chip and the color will never fade ⭐️ Lightweight, the tumbler is easy to carry and feels incredibly comfortable in your hand ⭐️ Spill proof-lid , to make sure you never spill your drink, while also straw friendly Add to cart right now and make sure you’re always cool in the summer and hot in the winter!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71li7Nk++2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Make Part","source_asin":"B07M9HZMX7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-478485","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07M9HZMX7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07M9HZMX7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
