window.products.push({"id":478564,"name":"Glamerge Reusable Nylon Produce Bags - Storage for Vegetables, Fruits, and Toys - Drawstring Stasher for Kitchen, and Home Organizing - Planet-Friendl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qNGgfGfQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Looking for a sustainable solution to your food storage needs? When it comes to carrying and keeping fresh produce, using a plastic container is the first option you consider during your weekly runs to the grocery. In the U.S., only 10% of single-use plastic waste is recycled. Most end up in landfills or pollute the oceans. Among the millions of metric tons dumped in the oceans annually is the disposable food storage you’re fond of using. They are partly responsible for the world’s alarming problem of plastic pollution. Keep your ingredients fresh and safely stored without harming the environment using Glamarge Nylon Produce Bags! We made use of sustainable materials in crafting your new reusable nylon mesh bags.  Compared to cotton, plastic and polyester options, this material boasts of staggering strength and tear resilience. The double stitching will come in handy for large ingredients such as fruits and root crops. Our bag’s drawstring closure and see-through mesh ensure effortless safekeeping when organizing your ingredients in the pantry or refrigerator. Its wide range of use allows you to keep a variety of items like books, kitchen towels, utensils, and toiletries. Due to this bag’s immense strength and heavy-duty construction, it can be an outdoor staple during camping, beach, and road trips. Store your home-prepped sandwiches and light snacks in our mesh bags while you’re on the road. Here are more reasons to start replacing single-use plastic containers with our nylon stashers: ✅ Breathable mesh extends the shelf life of your produce✅ Flexible and foldable for space-saving storage in drawers✅ Easy to wash and maintain✅ Compact size and lightweight Even the smallest steps have a big impact on the environment. Add Glamerge Nylon Produce Bags to your cart TODAY!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qNGgfGfQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Glamerge","source_asin":"B082359C6R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-478564","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082359C6R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082359C6R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
