window.products.push({"id":478726,"name":"Kenroy Home 92136BRZ Twigs Sconces, Medium, Blackened Bronze","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":131.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61m0iMTczuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description “Branching” out from a large collection of matching lamps and fixtures, this wall sconce has a distinct design personality that perfectly balances the combinations of rustic lodge-inspired looks with the elegance of cottage chic design. Animated and vine-like, natural-looking twigs encircle the amber scavo glass shade, contrasting the light amber color with the rich oil rubbed bronze and giving an airy-organic feel to each piece. With a wide variety of matching lamps, wallchieres, pendants and other pieces, this family is truly a rustic designer’s dream come true. From the Manufacturer Inspired by nature, this elegant collection blends the vibrance of a climbing vine with the soft glow of light. Twigs is ideal for both Asian-influenced and country-style rooms.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61m0iMTczuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kenroy Home","source_asin":"B0B25DYGB3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-478726","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B25DYGB3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B25DYGB3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
