window.products.push({"id":478897,"name":"SiviLuming Extra-Large Wearable Cleaning Caddy Organizer with Handle,Cleaning Supplies Organizer with Adjustable Shoulder,Cleaning Caddy with Detachab","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71X1hWnoSJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Oxford Fabric Upgrade to Plus Size:The New Extra Large Wearable Cleaning Caddy reaches 16 x （11+9） x 10 inches when assembled.Trapezoid containers are perfect for inclusive cleaning supplies of different heights to prevent falling out and help easy take out. Detachable dividers can be arranged freely to make 7 different right-sized compartments , for all of your cleaning supplies. No more running back and forth searching for cleaning products. Smart Design:Wearable Organizer for Cleaning Supplies with handles, adjustable shoulder, and waist buckle straps for a comfortable fit，allow you to be hands free while you work. You can put the cleaning bag on your shoulder or use its handle to pick it up, which is much easier to carry in and out of houses and cars.The waist straps keeping selected supplies upright as you move, stretch, bend, easy to clean corner areas. Sturdy and Durable:The Cleaning Caddy Bags extra large support years of use.Caddy organizer made of high-quality hybrid Oxford fabric,holds up under stress.The solid sides and thickened pad bottom greatly enhanced stability when in use.The Improved stainless steel clips and 4 corner shoulder strap connectors are more robust and durable undoubtedly. Large Capacity Storage:Cleaning Supply Caddy with 4 individual side pockets for storing scrub sponges,rags and small tools. Alligator clips are for clamping trash bags, shoe covers or face masks, plus the zip pocket is for safely storing your phone, cards and keys.Caddy bag keeps more compartments for various cleaning supplies like sprays, detergents, brushes, dusters, cloth, gloves, tools, and more to tackle multiple cleaning tasks. Washable Caddy for Multitasking:The wearable cleaning box with handle is washable and easy to clean.Rubber Mesh base prevents water from accumulating at the bottom and no bad smell. It also can be used as an organizer of car washing, gardening tools, painting things, under sink items, picnic items, utensils, beach and pool.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71X1hWnoSJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SiviLuming","source_asin":"B09ZJ7T1YG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-478897","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09ZJ7T1YG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09ZJ7T1YG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
