window.products.push({"id":478947,"name":"Decorative Blue Ceramic Vase Two-Tone Boho Flower Vase with Handle Pottery Bud Jug Vase for Flower Arrangement Glazed Rustic Farmhouse Floral Vase for","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CJn8AH9TL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Blue Vase for Home Decor】:Using superb glazing process and firing at high temperature, this pottery flower vase has a cracked effect on the upper surface, the bottom is designed to have a distressed cement effect, which is unique and vintage. Besides, we designed a handle to carry this rustic vase more easily. As the high temperature firing, the pattern of each blue pottery vases will be slightly different 【High Quality】:This floral vase is made from high quality ceramic, using superb glazing technology, it is hard to be out of shape, fade or paint off. The charm and smooth line from the bottleneck to the bottom, its surface is easy to clean. Each blue decorative vase are wraped with thick foam to avoid damage it during transportation 【Good Size】: The size of the jug vase is 5.1\"x9.2\"(D&H),and the jug mouth diameter is 2.5\", you can fill fresh flowers, dried flower, faux flowers, plant, branches, cotton, wheat into the large vase for flowers 【Widely Applications】: These modern vases are not only can be use as blue vases for flowers, but also it can be use as a decoration piece for home or office. This flower vase is also an ideal choice for your flower arrangement or ceramic lovers/family/friends/neighbors as a housewarming gift 【BLue Vases for Decor】: You can put your favorite filler into this vases for centerpieces, which will make DIY flower arrangement more fun and easy. This blue ceramic vase is perfect choice to place it on home, office, coffee table, dinning table center piece, bookshelf, fireplace, yard, bedroom, kitchen, bedroom, living room, etc","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CJn8AH9TL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Oairse","source_asin":"B09K3WQFSC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-478947","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09K3WQFSC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09K3WQFSC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":478948,"name":"Yankee Candle Passion Fruit Martini Scenterpiece Easy MeltCup 2.2 oz,Orange","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51MYDpnAEVL._AC_.jpg","description":"Sit back, relax and savor a tropical mix of passion fruit, mango, and zesty orange. It's like a long sip of a true beachside cocktail.Fragrance Notes:Top: Juicy Pineapple, Tropical Mango, Zesty OrangeMid: Passion FruitBase: MuskTop note is the initial impression of the fragrance, middle note is the main body of the scent and base is its final impression. About Scenterpiece Easy MeltCups: New! Change scents in seconds. First, select a stylish Easy MeltCup warmer. Then choose an Easy MeltCup in your favorite fragrances. Remove lid, place cup in the warmer, flip on the switch and enjoy. And because Easy MeltCups are always cool to the touch, you can swap them out as often as you like, continuing to use each cup for a total of up to 24 hours melt time..","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51MYDpnAEVL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yankee Candle","source_asin":"B01GGRDEF8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-478948","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01GGRDEF8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01GGRDEF8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":478949,"name":"DREAVIO Stone Bath Mat - Non Slip Diatomaceous Earth Bath Mat, Super Absorbent Quick Dry Shower Floor Mat, Suitable for Bathroom Tub, Kitchen Dish Dry","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":52.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EWJtYgC2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【QUICK DRY BATH MAT】Elevate your daily life you deserve with our luxurious DREAVIO Stone Bath Mat. Made from diatomaceous earth, our stone bathroom mat has exceptional absorbency and moisture-wicking properties that quickly evaporate water from the surface. Leaving your feet and bathroom dry in minutes when you step out of the shower, and keep your bathroom dry and hygienic at all times. 【SAY GOODBAY TO TRADITIONAL FABRIC BATH MATS】The diatomaceous earth bath mat avoids the moist pitfalls of the soft fabric mats. Features a tasteful and elegant design that provides optimal traction for wet feet and fully absorbs water in minutes, making the bath stone mats an all-natural alternative to damp and bacteria-laden fabric mats. While this mat is a great choice for bathrooms, you can also use it as a dish-drying mat or to put your pet’s food bowls on. 【ANTI-SLIP & SAFE】Get stable footing on the bathroom stone mat thanks to its non-slip pad. Put it underneath the diatomaceous earth mats to give it a good grip on the floor and keep it in place. The texture of the shower stone mat surface increases friction and minimizes the risk of slipping or falling.Please note that the bathrooms mats must be placed on a solid and flat surface. 【EASY CARE & MAINTENANCE】Unlike fabric mats that require constant washing, our diatomite bath mat only requires minimal maintenance. Simply rinse with water or wipe with a damp cloth; stubborn stains can be sanded with sandpaper (included) and will be new as before after drying. Gone are the hassles of constantly having to wash your bathroom rug. 【100% CUSTOMER SATISFACTION】AT DREAVIO, we're committed to creating premium-grade, eco-friendly home goods that last. We always stand behind our product. If any questions about the shower bathroom stone mat, please kindly contact us without hestiate. Our team will provide you with friendly and professionally services.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EWJtYgC2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DREAVIO","source_asin":"B0BR6DKPZG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-478949","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BR6DKPZG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BR6DKPZG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
