window.products.push({"id":478969,"name":"rezip 5-Piece Stand-Up Reusable Bag Bundle | BPA-Free, Food Grade, Leakproof, Freezer and Dishwasher Safe | Quart (1), 2-Cup (2), Snack (2) | Multicol","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/514+fJxM+KL._AC_SL1400_.jpg","description":"LEAKPROOF DOUBLE-LOCK CLOSURE: Each (re)zip provides an air tight seal that acutally clicks when sealed, making them durable and completely leakproof. Remarkably convenient for meal prep, food storage, and travel. WHAT FITS INSIDE: Quart bag can hold a full-on salad, travel-sized toiletries, a dog bone, tennis ball, and treats. 2-Cup bag can hold four sliced bananas, electronis and powercords, more leftovers. Snack bag can hold 3 hard-boiled eggs, croutons that stay crunchy, dressing for a salad. EASY TO CLEAN - Handwash is recommended for best results. Add a drop of dish soap with water to your bag. Seal it up and shake it around. Rinse thoroughly. (re)zips are top-rack dishwasher safe on a standard setting. Note: (re)zip bags are not intended for use in the microwave, sous vide, or in high heat. Make sure all hot foods have cooled before storing. THE ECO FRIENDLY CHOICE: Made from 100% BPA-free, lead-free, phthalate-free, and FDA food-grade PEVA, one (re)zip replaces up to 300 disposable baggies. INCLUDES: (1) Quart (4-Cup/32-Ounce), (2) 2-Cup (16-Ounce), (2) Snack (1-Cup/8-Ounce)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/514+fJxM+KL._AC_SL1400_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"(re)zip","source_asin":"B07D4B3DRN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-478969","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07D4B3DRN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07D4B3DRN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":478970,"name":"Hamilton Beach 35136 Meal Maker Multicooker, Silver","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41vA9GeZExL._AC_.jpg","description":"Housed in attractive stainless steel, this versatile cooker prepares a variety of foods and makes it easy to get dinner on the table quickly. The all-in-one appliance operates as a deep fryer, a steamer, and a slow cooker. Steaming and boiling retain foods' moisture, while frying sears food, making it crispy on the outside and juicy on the inside. When frying, the unit's roomy basket and deep oil level combine to accommodate a 2-pound bag of frozen fries or an entire 4-1/2-pound chicken. A complete chicken can be fried in about 35 minutes, quicker than oven roasting or rotisserie, making it a perfect choice for hectic weeknight meals. For added convenience, the basket can be raised and lowered with the lid in place, avoiding messy splatter and protecting the hands. The basket contains a hook to hold it above the liquid, which allows oil or water to drain off the food. Other details include a 5-quart liquid capacity, adjustable temperature control, ready lights, and a breakaway cord, which helps prevent the cooker from tipping over if the cord gets snagged. The unit assembles in no time and disassembles easily, making cleanup a snap. The multi-cooker appliance measures approximately 15 by 15 by 17 inches and carries a one-year warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41vA9GeZExL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hamilton Beach","source_asin":"B000R8E8QM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-478970","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000R8E8QM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000R8E8QM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":478971,"name":"Air Conditioner Hose, Portable Exhaust Vent Hose with 5.1 Inch Diameter, Clockwise AC Hose Length up to 78.7 Inch, Universal Replacement AC Vent Hose ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813-3sA5q5S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Wanna get rid of the heat? Wanna enjoy the cool wind in hot summer days? Or the portable air conditioner hose purchased before is not durable? Don't worry, our hose meets all your needs, and it will make you happy and cool. Try to imagine, in hot summer days, with our portable air conditioner hose, don’t need to worry about the heat, just be happy with your family and friends at home, just work at ease in the office, why not? It’s the most wonderful one for beating the heat. √Made of high-quality Polypropylene＆Stainless steel, this material is durable and superior, for one, they won’t be harmful to your health, for another, they can work at high temperatures, works－30℃~140℃.  √Save your time. It’s easy to install, just check your hose diameter and thread direction, align the portable air conditioner exhaust vent, turn clockwise or counterclockwise according to the thread direction you purchased, then finally put the hose out of the window. √And you will enjoy the cool wind at home and in the office, just say goodbye to the hot weather. Reminder: Our hoses are available in both clockwise and counterclockwise with different diameters. Before purchasing, please make sure the size and thread are compatible with your portable ac units. Package includes： 1*Portable Air Conditioner Hose Specifications: Color: White Material: Polypropylene＆Stainless steel  Diameter: 5.1 inches/ 13 cm, 5.9inches/15cm Maximum Length: 78.7 inches / 2m Minimum Length: 15.7 inches / 40cm Thread Direction: Clockwise, Counterclockwise","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813-3sA5q5S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jin&Bao","source_asin":"B08B3DRHWP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-478971","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08B3DRHWP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08B3DRHWP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
